<title>USA: MGE shrimp deliveries - Nov 8.</title>
<headline>MGE shrimp deliveries - Nov 8.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange Grain reported the following deliveries against November shrimp futures (in lots) -</p>
<p>BLACK TIGER SHRIMP - 3 lots. Oldest long - Oct 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - Cargill Investor Services/c 3.</p>
<p>Received - Cargill Investor Services/c 2, Goldenberg Heymeyer/c 1.</p>
<p>H=House. C=Customer account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
